{
  "name": "Timetrack 06 — HR System Sync",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Исходящая синхронизация (outbox → HR-система)\nКаждые 15 минут: `fn_outbox_claim()` забирает пачку событий (attendance.created/updated, employee.upserted, consent.revoked), каждое отправляется `POST` на адрес из Config; результат фиксируется `fn_outbox_mark()` (повтор с экспоненциальной паузой, после 10 попыток — dead). Формат payload описан в docs/hr-integration.md. Для другой HR-системы замените ноду Push To HR System (например, на ноду BambooHR/Personio/1C HTTP).",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 1500,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "9400a3da-8aed-5e9a-9bed-2ceec0315b59",
      "name": "Sticky Note 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        160,
        -180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Входящая синхронизация (HR-система → справочник)\n`POST /webhook/timetrack/hr/employees` (HR/system-токен) с `{ \"employees\": [ { employee_id, full_name, email, department, position, timezone, work_schedule, hr_external_id, status } ] }`. Каждая запись проходит через `fn_upsert_employee()`; статус `terminated` запускает удаление биометрии по политике хранения (воркфлоу 07).",
        "height": 170,
        "width": 1500,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "3800ca88-32b2-5b8e-b059-7d7c121395f6",
      "name": "Sticky Note 2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        160,
        740
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "*/15 * * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "4da38476-694f-52fb-80ab-5f4d2cc0fbf3",
      "name": "Sync Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        160,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "814da20f-9947-5514-8469-6ea30e327387",
              "name": "hrSystemUrl",
              "value": "https://hr.example.com/api/timetrack/events",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "692345c9-84cc-56e5-96c8-8ec849e17207",
              "name": "batchSize",
              "value": 100,
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "1dd55b86-c6be-58de-8b88-f532cfdc43f4",
              "name": "maxAttempts",
              "value": 10,
              "type": "number"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": false,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "f83d06d9-f913-5657-8251-32b768817afe",
      "name": "Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        440,
        300
      ],
      "notes": "URL приёмника событий в HR-системе. Аутентификация — credential \"HR System API\" (заголовок).",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "SELECT id, event_kind, entity_type, entity_id, payload, attempts, created_at FROM timetrack.fn_outbox_claim($1::int)",
        "options": {
          "queryReplacement": "={{ [ $('Config').first().json.batchSize ] }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "b57e99fc-2234-58cb-b855-293de6c648f8",
      "name": "Claim Outbox Batch",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "typeVersion": 2.5,
      "position": [
        720,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "postgres": {
          "id": "timetrack-postgres",
          "name": "Timetrack Postgres"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Config').first().json.hrSystemUrl }}",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "fullResponse": true,
              "neverError": true
            }
          },
          "batching": {
            "batch": {
              "batchSize": 10,
              "batchInterval": 500
            }
          }
        },
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "json",
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ ({ id: $json.id, kind: $json.event_kind, entity_type: $json.entity_type, entity_id: $json.entity_id, created_at: $json.created_at, attempt: $json.attempts, data: $json.payload }) }}"
      },
      "id": "fbf5f8aa-fb04-5194-8cf0-a843e38da91f",
      "name": "Push To HR System",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1000,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "timetrack-hr-api",
          "name": "HR System API"
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "jsCode": "// Результат доставки одного события outbox в HR-систему.\nconst resp = $json;\nconst src = $('Claim Outbox Batch').item.json;\nconst status = Number(resp.statusCode ?? 0);\nconst ok = !resp.error && status >= 200 && status < 300;\nlet error = null;\nif (!ok) {\n  const detail = resp.error ? (resp.error.message || JSON.stringify(resp.error)) : JSON.stringify(resp.body ?? '');\n  error = ('HTTP ' + status + ' ' + String(detail)).slice(0, 1500);\n}\nreturn { json: { outbox_id: src.id, event_kind: src.event_kind, ok, error } };\n"
      },
      "id": "758cc87e-6d21-563c-b204-5732fd5f8949",
      "name": "Evaluate Delivery",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1280,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "SELECT timetrack.fn_outbox_mark($1::bigint, $2::boolean, $3, $4::int) AS marked",
        "options": {
          "queryReplacement": "={{ [ $json.outbox_id, $json.ok === true, $json.error ?? null, $('Config').first().json.maxAttempts ] }}",
          "queryBatching": "independently"
        }
      },
      "id": "8982cdbf-7af7-5196-b4ac-84997f76b676",
      "name": "Mark Outbox",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "typeVersion": 2.5,
      "position": [
        1560,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "postgres": {
          "id": "timetrack-postgres",
          "name": "Timetrack Postgres"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "timetrack/hr/employees",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "1821d165-f424-5396-8a6e-b9bf3c523b7d",
      "name": "HR Inbound Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        160,
        940
      ],
      "webhookId": "b2db6759-606e-5f9b-8355-519cce56c5bd"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "SELECT client_id, client_name, role, employee_id, location FROM timetrack.fn_authenticate($1)",
        "options": {
          "queryReplacement": "={{ [ (($('HR Inbound Webhook').first().json.headers['x-api-token'] || ($('HR Inbound Webhook').first().json.headers.authorization || '').replace(/^Bearer\\s+/i, '')) || '') ] }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "50138c65-b591-516e-a6bf-c0a4d1310bc4",
      "name": "Authenticate HR Sync",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "typeVersion": 2.5,
      "position": [
        440,
        940
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "postgres": {
          "id": "timetrack-postgres",
          "name": "Timetrack Postgres"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Токен из заголовка X-Api-Token или Authorization: Bearer. Пустой результат = неверный токен.",
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "alwaysOutputData": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "753d8099-d851-5934-92e5-3dc91c84509e",
              "leftValue": "={{ ['hr', 'system'].includes($json.role ?? '') }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "cc0f3638-efe8-56e8-a286-8f2c5bc0d2c2",
      "name": "Is HR System?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        720,
        940
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ ({ ok: false, code: 'unauthorized', message: 'Неверный или отсутствующий API-токен' }) }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 401
        }
      },
      "id": "3f8ced2c-34f3-52f2-b382-d83f8b726521",
      "name": "Respond 401",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1000,
        1140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "// Входящая синхронизация из HR-системы: { employees: [ {...}, ... ] }\nconst body = $('HR Inbound Webhook').first().json.body || {};\nconst list = Array.isArray(body.employees) ? body.employees : (Array.isArray(body) ? body : null);\nconst problems = [];\nif (!list) problems.push('employees_array_required');\nelse if (list.length === 0) problems.push('employees_empty');\nelse if (list.length > 5000) problems.push('too_many_employees');\nconst employees = (list || []).map((e) => ({\n  employee_id: String(e.employee_id ?? e.id ?? '').trim(),\n  full_name: String(e.full_name ?? e.name ?? '').trim(),\n  email: e.email ? String(e.email).trim() : null,\n  department: e.department ?? null,\n  position: e.position ?? null,\n  timezone: e.timezone ?? null,\n  work_schedule: e.work_schedule && typeof e.work_schedule === 'object' ? e.work_schedule : null,\n  hr_external_id: e.hr_external_id != null ? String(e.hr_external_id) : null,\n  status: ['active', 'inactive', 'terminated'].includes(e.status) ? e.status : null,\n}));\nconst bad = employees.filter((e) => !/^[A-Za-z0-9._-]{1,64}$/.test(e.employee_id) || e.full_name.length < 2);\nif (bad.length) problems.push('invalid_records:' + bad.length);\nreturn [{ json: { ok: problems.length === 0, problems, employees, actor: $input.first().json.client_name } }];\n"
      },
      "id": "c8fc13cb-4d9a-5025-9de7-e0ca6527c741",
      "name": "Validate Payload",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1000,
        940
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "7b19538b-828c-554e-936f-e95628ed6b03",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.ok === true }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "dee34916-794c-5b43-9fd6-be36a03a3a42",
      "name": "Payload Valid?",
